          deckDescription: 'Rummikub uses 106 tiles: 104 numbered tiles (numbers 1 to 13 in four colors—black, red, blue, orange—two of each number and color) plus two jokers that substitute for any tile. Tiles are kept on racks; the remainder forms the face-down pool.',
          suitDescription: 'Four colors function as suits: black, red, blue, and orange. Each color has two tiles of each number 1–13; jokers have no color and can represent any number and color in melds.',
          rankDescription: 'Numbers 1 through 13; 1 is always low in runs (e.g. 1-2-3 valid, 12-13-1 not in Sabra). Two tiles per number per color; jokers count as the tile they represent for initial meld value and scoring.',
          dealPattern: '14 tiles each; remainder to stock.',
          bettingLimits: 'NA',
